’s smile","sorriso do ator"],["office comedy","comédia de escritório"],["badge number","número do crachá"],["workplace humour","humor de trabalho"],["badge rule","badge rule"],["manager scene","manager scene"],["pin badge","pin badge"],["entry check","entry check"],["play comedy","play comedy"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story and play excerpt","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The New Rule","paras":["“All employees **are required to** wear a badge,” said the manager. Tom frowned. “Do I **have to**?” “Yes. You **must** show it at the door.” “And if I forget?” “You **will have to** go home and get it.”","Tom smiled and **pinned** it to his jacket. “Fine. I **needn’t** worry about forgetting now.”"],"kicker":"PLAY","by":"Original scene","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Employees are required to wear a badge.","ans":"T","why":"are required to wear."},{"q":"Tom refuses to wear it.","ans":"F","why":"pinned it to his jacket."},{"q":"If Tom forgets, he will have to go home.","ans":"T","why":"go home and get it."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“badge” = ?","opts":["crachá","bagagem","banco"],"ans":0,"why":"badge."},{"q":"“frown” = ?","opts":["franzir a testa","sorrir","gritar"],"ans":0,"why":"frown."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Obrigação em diálogos","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["Do I have to…?","**Yes, you must. / No, you don’t have to.**"],["Must I…?","**Yes, you must.**"],["Am I required to…?","**Yes, you’re required to.**"],["passado/futuro","**had to / will have to**"]],"cap":"Obrigação em diálogos"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"*must* é presente/futuro; no passado e no futuro use **had to / will have to**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"All employees are ___ to wear a badge. (requir